  {
   "kind": "prompt",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#vague-brief",
   "title": "Vague brief: prompt",
   "text": "Make me a cool scroll website with animations."
  },
  {
   "kind": "section",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#specific-brief",
   "title": "Specific brief",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "kind": "prompt",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#specific-brief",
   "title": "Specific brief: prompt",
   "text": "Goal: a one-page site for a fictional studio called Northlight, built in plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript.\n\nContext: it is a teaching example. The three files are index.html, style.css and app.js. Dark theme, one accent colour.\n\nBuild, in this order:\n1. A hero with two parallax layers (speeds 0.2 and 0.4).\n2. A sentence that lights up word by word as I scroll through a sticky section.\n3. Three cards that fade up when they enter the viewport, once.\n4. A pinned horizontal gallery with five panels.\n\nConstraints: Lenis 1.1.18 from jsDelivr for smooth scroll. Transform and opacity only. Reduced motion switches everything off.\n\nOutput: the three files, nothing else. Then list what you tested and what you could not test."
  },
  {
   "kind": "section",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#rules-file",
   "title": "Rules file",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "kind": "section",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#six-patterns",
   "title": "Six patterns",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "kind": "section",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#plan-before-code",
   "title": "Plan before code",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "kind": "prompt",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#plan-before-code",
   "title": "Plan before code: prompt",
   "text": "Do not write code yet. List the files you will change, the order, and the risks. Wait for my approval."
  },
  {
   "kind": "section",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#one-change-at-a-time",
   "title": "One change at a time",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "kind": "prompt",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#one-change-at-a-time",
   "title": "One change at a time: prompt",
   "text": "Make only this change: [change]. Do not touch anything else. Tell me which lines you edited."
  },
  {
   "kind": "section",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#show-the-evidence",
   "title": "Ask for evidence",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "kind": "prompt",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#show-the-evidence",
   "title": "Ask for evidence: prompt",
   "text": "Open the page at 375 px and 1440 px. Report the console errors verbatim, and name every element that overflows."
  },
  {
   "kind": "section",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#review-as-a-sceptic",
   "title": "Review as a sceptic",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "kind": "prompt",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#review-as-a-sceptic",
   "title": "Review as a sceptic: prompt",
   "text": "Review this page as a hostile reviewer. List the five weakest points: performance, accessibility, motion that could cause discomfort, and anything that looks invented."
  },
  {
   "kind": "section",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#make-it-teach-you",
   "title": "Make it teach you",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "kind": "prompt",
   "chapter": "Prompting",
   "href": "/prompting#make-it-teach-you",
   "title": "Make it teach you: prompt",
   "text": "Explain how the parallax maths works in plain terms, with one numeric example. Then say what would break if the speed were 0.9."
  },
